---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { appLabel, appUrl } from "../lib/site";
import {
  currentDesktopSource,
  historicalDesktopRelease as release,
  releaseRepository,
  releaseSnapshot,
} from "../lib/release-inventory";
---
<SiteLayout title="下载与发行状态 — Dovspace" description="核对 Dovspace 当前源码与历史桌面预发布的版本、平台、摘要、签名及源码证据。未完成验收的安装入口保持禁用。">
  <section class="download-page container">
    <header class="download-head">
      <img class="app-icon" src="/dovspace.svg?v=20261115" width="66" height="66" alt="" />
      <h1>Dovspace 下载与发行状态</h1>
      <p>有历史预发布材料，不等于当前版本已经可以安装。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="release-summary" aria-labelledby="current-release-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">CURRENT SOURCE · NOT A RELEASE</p>
      <h2 id="current-release-heading">当前源码：暂不提供安装下载</h2>
      <dl class="release-meta">
        <div><dt>源码声明版本</dt><dd><code>{currentDesktopSource.declaredVersion}</code>；不是已验收的安装包版本</dd></div>
        <div><dt>发行通道</dt><dd>未发布；不能仅按版本后缀认定已有 preview 安装包</dd></div>
        <div><dt>平台／原生验收</dt><dd>{currentDesktopSource.installation.reason}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>安装器、摘要与签名</dt><dd>{currentDesktopSource.materials.reason}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>精确源码身份</dt><dd>{currentDesktopSource.sourceIdentity.reason}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>发行许可门禁</dt><dd>{currentDesktopSource.openReleaseBlockers.map((blocker, index) => <>{index > 0 && "、"}<code>{blocker}</code></>)} 仍为 OPEN；<a href="/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt">核对第三方说明</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="release-links"><a class="text-link" href="/get-started/">开始源码自托管 →</a><a class="text-link" href="/desktop/#build">原生构建前提 →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="historical-release-heading">
      <header class="release-history-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">HISTORICAL RELEASE INVENTORY</p>
        <h2 id="historical-release-heading">可核对的历史预发布材料</h2>
        <p>公开资料核对日期：<time datetime={releaseSnapshot.reviewedOn}>{releaseSnapshot.reviewedOn}</time>。{releaseSnapshot.scope}</p>
        <p>历史标签 <code>{release.tag}</code>，通道 <code>{release.channel}</code>，发布于 <time datetime={release.publishedAt}>{release.publishedAt.slice(0, 10)}</time>；三个平台清单的<strong>包内版本实际为 <code>{release.applicationVersion}</code></strong>。标签与包内版本不同，不按当前发行规则视为合格新包。</p>
        <p class="release-links"><a class="text-link" href={release.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看该历史发行说明 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={releaseRepository.releasesUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">浏览仓库 Releases ↗</a></p>
      </header>
      <div class="download-grid">
        {release.platforms.map((platform) => (
          <article class="download-card" aria-labelledby={`release-${platform.target}-heading`}>
            <span class="platform-mark" aria-hidden="true">{platform.mark}</span>
            <h3 id={`release-${platform.target}-heading`}>{platform.name}</h3>
            <p class="arch">{platform.architecture}</p>
            <p class="format">{platform.format}</p>
            <dl class="release-meta">
              <div><dt>历史包内版本</dt><dd><code>{release.applicationVersion}</code></dd></div>
              <div><dt>标签／通道</dt><dd><code>{release.tag}</code> / <code>{release.channel}</code></dd></div>
              <div><dt>平台／架构</dt><dd><code>{platform.target}</code></dd></div>
              <div><dt>签名状态</dt><dd>{platform.signature === "unsigned" ? "未签名 · 仅供测试" : "仅 ad-hoc；非 Developer ID 签名"}</dd></div>
              <div><dt>公证状态</dt><dd>{platform.notarization === "not-applicable" ? "不适用（Windows）" : "未公证"}</dd></div>
              <div><dt>声明的历史源码</dt><dd><a href={release.source.commitUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><code>{release.source.commit}</code></a>；依据 tag 与发行说明，非包内源码身份验证</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <span class="btn btn-disabled" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby={`release-${platform.target}-reason`}>安装下载未开放</span>
            <p id={`release-${platform.target}-reason`} class="small-note">{platform.installation.reason}</p>
            <p class="small-note">{platform.requirement}</p>
            <details class="release-artifacts-details">
              <summary>资产与 SHA256（{platform.artifacts.length} 项）</summary>
              <ul class="release-artifacts">
                {platform.artifacts.map((artifact) => (
                  <li>
                    <p><code>{artifact.name}</code></p>
                    <p>{artifact.bytes.toLocaleString("en-US")} bytes</p>
                    <p>SHA256：<code>{artifact.sha256}</code></p>
                    <a class="text-link" href={artifact.metadataUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">核对该资产的 API 元数据 ↗</a>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </details>
            <p><a class="text-link" href={platform.manifestUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看历史平台 JSON 清单 ↗</a></p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="download-note">上方是历史资产记录，不是面向当前版本的安装推荐。Windows unsigned preview 仅供测试；macOS ad-hoc 不等于正式签名或公证。平台清单、摘要和历史冒烟不能替代安装／升级／卸载、GUI、真实 Provider 及许可验收。<a href="/desktop/">查看桌面说明</a>。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="release-summary" aria-labelledby="release-evidence-heading">
      <h2 id="release-evidence-heading">摘要、源码与缺失材料分别核对</h2>
      <p class="release-evidence-note">{release.checksums.evidence}</p>
      <p class="release-links"><a class="text-link" href={release.checksums.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">历史 SHA256SUMS.txt ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={release.source.tagEvidenceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">历史 tag → commit 证据 ↗</a></p>
      <ul class="release-gap-list">
        <li><strong>包与源码的精确绑定：未证实。</strong>{release.source.packageIdentity.reason}</li>
        <li><strong>当前格式发行材料：不可用。</strong>{release.materials.reason}</li>
        <li><strong>完整原生验收：未证实。</strong>{release.nativeAcceptance.reason}</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="release-evidence-note">下列源码 ZIP 只归档历史提交的仓库内容，不是经过核验的完整对应源码交付，也不包含当前本地改动。会话与持久化统一设计仍未收口，继续沿用 Agent Chat；历史包也不承诺新版本的更新能力。</p>
      <p class="release-links"><a class="text-link" href={release.source.commitUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">浏览历史精确提交 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={release.source.archiveUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">该历史提交的 GitHub 源码 ZIP ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={releaseRepository.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">仓库首页（非成品源码证明）↗</a></p>
      <p class="release-evidence-note">本页记录 {releaseSnapshot.publicReleaseCount} 个公开历史预发布，不实时抓取网络资料。<a href={releaseSnapshot.inventoryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">核对公开 Releases API</a>与<a href={release.apiUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">本次历史发行的 API 记录</a>；仓库公开状态见<a href={releaseRepository.metadataUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">仓库 API</a>，不沿用旧发行说明中的私有仓库描述。页面不发布 Release，也不因配置外部链接开放安装。</p>
    </section>

    <div class="web-card tile">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">IN YOUR BROWSER</p><h2>从源码自托管，使用浏览器。</h2><p>已有服务可打开自己的工作台；尚未安装请先阅读<a href="/get-started/">入门指南</a>。这与桌面历史安装包是不同路径。</p></div>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={appUrl}>{appLabel} ↗</a>
    </div>
    <details class="build-details">
      <summary>从源码构建桌面 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary>
      <p>在匹配目标 OS／CPU 的独立 Windows / macOS 原生构建检出中，使用 Node.js 24.21.0 和 pnpm 11.9.0；完整工具前提见<a href="/desktop/#build">桌面构建说明</a>。打包会重建产品，不在正在提供服务的检出中执行。</p>
      <pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="桌面源码构建命令"><code>node scripts/doctor.mjs
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm --filter @agent-workspace/desktop runtime:prepare
pnpm --filter @agent-workspace/desktop package</code></pre>
      <p>默认生成 unsigned 测试包，不是已验收发行。Git、Provider CLI 与账号需要另外配置；当前版本的源码身份、原生验收及发行许可仍须独立闭合。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={releaseRepository.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">浏览公开源码仓库，自行选择构建提交 ↗</a>
    </details>
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← 返回首页</a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
